  "title": "The 50-color theorem for t-perfect graphs",
  "abstract": "A Lean proof that every finite t-perfect graph is 50-colorable. Here t-perfection means equality between the stable set polytope and the polytope described by coordinate, edge, and odd-cycle inequalities.",
